   "texts": [
    "牛仔裤、干草和艺术品挂在构架上，颜色与卧室墙壁相同，呈浅绿色",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "50289579"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/bb/91/bb91f9c269a5e9a4058cd08f26056e27.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
